# Formspree form ID for the contact form.
# This is a PUBLIC endpoint identifier, not a secret — it ships in the bundle.
#
# 1. Create a free form at https://formspree.io (50 submissions/month)
# 2. Copy the ID from the endpoint URL: https://formspree.io/f/<THIS_PART>
# 3. Put it below, and copy this file to .env
#
# For GitHub Actions deploys, also add it as a repository *variable* named
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ID (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → Variables).
# Without it the deployed form posts to /f/undefined and silently fails.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
